ution into a container and wait for it to crystallize.\n4. Strike the crystallized piezoelectric element and see if it generates electricity.\n5. Assemble the piezoelectric element onto a piezoelectric plate.\n6. Try tapping the piezoelectric plate with a hammer or hitting it with a ball to turn on the lantern and charge the battery.", "short_description": "Discover how certain materials generate electricity when subjected to mechanical stress. This experiment explores the applications of the piezoelectric effect in generating renewable energy."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8609132155873567"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75530712_751357767147708_904292925939110151_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=akDrhXeGgWQQ7kNvwFiGe9K&_nc_oc=Adn1RoG1o20Z4NnRByPNUwzF9YnM9koSKSid6VRH7dNnWociy3dhd_bCGCtSH97A-hA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwg-sRzQCq6XmLNEFE21MTTM-f300XMEszKZOFIn99wwQ&oe=69B01D